<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 1,500 MT were primarily the result of increases for Hong Kong (14,000 MT), Morocco (14,000 MT), and Canada (3,200 MT) being nearly offset by reductions for unknown destinations (15,000 MT) and China (12,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 3,000 MT were to Mexico (2,400 MT) and Haiti (600 MT).</p>
</text>
